  ],
  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{自習|じしゅう}する (to self-study)\n・{自習|じしゅう}{時間|じかん} (self-study period)\n・{自習|じしゅう}{室|しつ} (study room)\n\nSCHOOL CONTEXT:\nIn Japanese schools, when a teacher is absent, students often have {自習|じしゅう} - a supervised period where they study on their own.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{独学|どくがく} - self-teaching (learning something entirely on your own)\n・{予習|よしゅう} - preparation (studying before class)\n・{復習|ふくしゅう} - review (studying after class)\n\n[Register: Neutral]",
